WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.900
Vhidhiyo iyi inotsanangura zvakajairika uye zvisina kujairika fundal red reflex kutaridzika.

2
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Yakajairika fundal dzvuku reflex bvunzo ndipo pasina musiyano wakazara mukupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri ane epakati cornea ratidziro.

3
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:31.530
Kunyangwe chitarisiko chakajairika cheiyo fundal reflex, zvisinei, chinosiyana zvichienderana nekuti uri kure sei uye kuti mwana anotarisa kupi.

4
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:42.010
Kuongorora kunoshanda uko kwaunofanirwa kufamba uchienda kudivi nekudzoka uye mberi mukati nekutenderedza ruoko kubva kumurwere.

5
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:51.350
Vacheche nevana vachafambisawo maoko avo nemaziso, zvichiita kuti reflex ichinje maitiro ayo panguva yekuongorora.

6
00:00:51.910 --> 00:01:02.350
Mumwana mutema, reflex yacho inotaridzika kucheneruka, ine yero uye chena uye dzimwe nguva bhuruu seruvara rukuru.

7
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:14.970
Zvakakosha, mukuongororwa kwakajairwa, hapafanirwe kuve nemusiyano wakazara mukupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri ane epakati corneal reflections.

8
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:23.850
An abnormal reflex kana paine kuramba kuchienderera, musiyano chaiwo mukupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri.

9
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:35.840
A displaced corneal reflection, chigamba chakasviba chiripo mukati me reflex yerimwe ziso kana maziso ose, kana kushaikwa zvachose tsvuku reflex.

10
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:56.330
Abnormal reflex test inogona kuratidza kuvepo kwecataract, retinoblastoma, corneal scar, squint, refractive kukanganisa kana matambudziko ekuzvarwa akadai secoloboma.

11
00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.690
Izvi zvese zvinoda kumwe kuongororwa nenyanzvi.

12
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Tarisa pane iyi reflex uye zvibvunze iwe: izvi zvakajairika kana zvisina kujairika? Mhinduro dzinozotevera mushure.

13
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:45.840
Iwe zvino unofanirwa kuve nekunzwisisa zvirinani kuti chimiro chenguva dzose chinoratidzika sei, pamwe chete nemafungiro asina kujairika, uye kukwanisa kupa chikonzero chingangonyanya kukonzera.
